This is an ALTERED version of the ed25519 library by Orson Peters.
It is not the original software. See license.txt, clause 2.

Upstream: https://github.com/orlp/ed25519

Changes from upstream, made by the Keystone Enclave project and inherited by
the riscv-vela project:

  * The hash function was changed from SHA-512 to SHA-3 (Keccak). The
    signatures produced by this version are therefore NOT interoperable
    with upstream ed25519 or with RFC 8032 Ed25519.
      - sha512.h / sha512_* calls replaced with common/sha3.h and sha3_*
      - affects sign.c, verify.c, keypair.c
  * Include paths were rewritten to be relative to the SDK include root
    (e.g. "ge.h" -> "ed25519/ge.h").
  * The sources were reformatted to the Keystone code style. Most of the
    line-level difference against upstream is reformatting only.
  * The random seed generation (seed.c) and SHA-512 sources from upstream
    are not vendored here.

The upstream license (Zlib) continues to apply to this code; see license.txt.
